    "body": "I think this would be reasonable if it would be something bindings generators could use to generate generic code. I'm not sure if that is the case; we'd want to do an audit of existing platform uses of [triggered by user activation](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#triggered-by-user-activation).\n\nIf we did, we would probably define it as an extended attribute in HTML, since HTML is what defines triggered by user activation.\n",
